              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mina Johane ngithi kuwo amabandla ayisikhombisa aseAsiya: Kakube kini umusa lokuthula okuvela kuye okhona lowayekhona lozakuba khona, lakubomoya abayisikhombisa abaphambi kwesihlalo sakhe sobukhosi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
