        {
          "text": "Khangelani, uyeza lamayezi; amehlo wonke azakumbona, labo bonke abamgwazayo; lezizwe zonke zomhlaba zizakulila ngenxa yakhe. Yebo, kuzakuba njalo. Ameni.",
          "type": "text",
