        {
          "text": "Wayephethe izinkanyezi eziyisikhombisa esandleni sakhe sokunene, lasemlonyeni wakhe kwaphuma umhedla obukhali inxa zombili, lobuso bakhe bunjengelanga elikhanya ngamandla. ",
